@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:architecture] request-accounting-local-measurement-only
This library MUST perform only source-local numeric measurement and private
recording-quality I/O. It MUST NOT acquire application, database or guest authority.
The shared protocol library MUST remain independent of this runtime library.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:security] request-accounting-secret-free
Producer RPC and persistence MUST contain only closed numeric accounting data
and quality states. Request identities, payloads, credentials and exception text
MUST NOT enter the recorder, persisted markers or diagnostics.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:reliability;security] request-accounting-aggregate-boundary
The aggregate MUST expose only the reviewed service roster, fixed duration
bounds, terminal outcomes and stable v1 snapshot fields. It MUST NOT retain
request identifiers, payloads, credentials, exception text or arbitrary labels.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:verification] request-accounting-aggregate-conservation
For every aggregate snapshot, requests MUST equal successes plus failures and
duration bucket totals MUST equal duration count. Missing durations MUST remain
unmeasured; excluded outcomes MUST not alter the denominator.
